    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MOBA for the MASTERS!!! Can you handle it?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You command an immensely powerful <strong>Xalium Battle Tank (XBT)</strong>. You need TRUE SKILL to handle the speed, the aim, the swarms and the tactical depth!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Enemy Heroes Weaving Through Swarms of Minions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.poster.avif?t=1750748590\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.webm?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.mp4?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>100+ minions per team, per avenue, per minute</strong>, the battlefield is teeming with thousands. Whether you are obliterating minions in clusters, swarming heroes or overwhelming turrets, once you adapt to the this new scale of war, no other MOBA will compare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Jungle Accomplishing Missions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.poster.avif?t=1750748590\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.webm?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.mp4?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger and riches abound in the streets of Rotnor. The city is divided into two halves, each with four neighborhoods inhabited by neutral factions: police, military, pirates, and Xorm. Decide who to <strong>ally </strong>with, <strong>undertake missions</strong> for them, and secure vital <strong>upgrades </strong>that can shift the balance of power. Once you\u2019re strong enough, rally your team to challenge <strong>mighty Mantis</strong>, the rogue XBT, for a reward that could change the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance Your Build with Modifications and Upgrades:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.poster.avif?t=1750748590\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.webm?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.mp4?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the battle tank and pilot that align with your team role from an ever-growing pool of options. Every five levels, enhance your skills with <strong>modifications</strong>. Acquire <strong>upgrades </strong>to tailor your tank to your distinctive playing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demolish Everything to Forge New Paths Reshaping the Map:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.poster.avif?t=1750748590\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.webm?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.mp4?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re piloting a battle tank in a city, with the <strong>power to destroy anything</strong> in your path. Create new routes between lanes through the jungle, ambush enemies from behind, or surprise them with backdoor attacks just when they think they\u2019ve won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up, Commander!</strong> Assemble your team, strategize your build, and carve your path through the chaos. The swarm is relentless, the city is yours to reshape, and victory demands TRUE SKILL. <strong>Wishlist SSA now and dominate the battlefield!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MOBA for the MASTERS!!! Can you handle it?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You command an immensely powerful <strong>Xalium Battle Tank (XBT)</strong>. You need TRUE SKILL to handle the speed, the aim, the swarms and the tactical depth!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Enemy Heroes Weaving Through Swarms of Minions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.poster.avif?t=1750748590\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.webm?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/e5ee36e89d677f45744488d9c254c889.mp4?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>100+ minions per team, per avenue, per minute</strong>, the battlefield is teeming with thousands. Whether you are obliterating minions in clusters, swarming heroes or overwhelming turrets, once you adapt to the this new scale of war, no other MOBA will compare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Jungle Accomplishing Missions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.poster.avif?t=1750748590\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.webm?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/dada5670ddace35db3e7013a5e407717.mp4?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger and riches abound in the streets of Rotnor. The city is divided into two halves, each with four neighborhoods inhabited by neutral factions: police, military, pirates, and Xorm. Decide who to <strong>ally </strong>with, <strong>undertake missions</strong> for them, and secure vital <strong>upgrades </strong>that can shift the balance of power. Once you\u2019re strong enough, rally your team to challenge <strong>mighty Mantis</strong>, the rogue XBT, for a reward that could change the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance Your Build with Modifications and Upgrades:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.poster.avif?t=1750748590\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.webm?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/71dad59c784029f4c8b3b99ef23006aa.mp4?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the battle tank and pilot that align with your team role from an ever-growing pool of options. Every five levels, enhance your skills with <strong>modifications</strong>. Acquire <strong>upgrades </strong>to tailor your tank to your distinctive playing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demolish Everything to Forge New Paths Reshaping the Map:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.poster.avif?t=1750748590\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.webm?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199180/extras/6d814ed71a89da0de70ebb1347d89ab9.mp4?t=1750748590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re piloting a battle tank in a city, with the <strong>power to destroy anything</strong> in your path. Create new routes between lanes through the jungle, ambush enemies from behind, or surprise them with backdoor attacks just when they think they\u2019ve won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up, Commander!</strong> Assemble your team, strategize your build, and carve your path through the chaos. The swarm is relentless, the city is yours to reshape, and victory demands TRUE SKILL. <strong>Wishlist SSA now and dominate the battlefield!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "SSA is the HARDEST MOBA (5 vs 5, 3 lanes, destroy HQ)! But SSA needs TRUE SKILL: SPEED, AIM and STRATEGY! Battle enemy heroes weaving through swarms, explore the jungle accomplishing missions, enhance your build with mods and upgrades, and demolish the city to forge new paths altering the map.",
